# Whalefall: The Seabed, track 2 (SPEC 19.6). A high-speed run over the
# salt pan through a line of whale skeletons: their ribs stand either side
# of the road as arches (gates), their shadows across the salt. Down the
# east side under the second skeleton, the long S through the coral field,
# the tide pools at the bottom of the bend, a salt crust over a brine pool
# on the south reach (the car behind falls through), and up the west side
# under the third.
name WHALEFALL
order 2
floor salt
background flats
league seabed
width 60
# x    y    half   features
 200  140   60     shadow,len=10   # start line, heading east; the first skeleton
 520  120   60
 820  150   60     crates
 910  300   58     shadow,len=10   # the second skeleton down the east side
 880  480   56
 720  560   56
 560  500   56
 400  560   56     drift,p=40      # dead coral
 380  680   56
 540  740   56
 740  720   56     coolant         # tide pools
 870  780   56
 890  870   56
 760  910   58
 480  900   58     crust           # salt crust over brine
 240  900   58     crates
 130  760   58
 130  520   58     shadow,len=10   # the third skeleton up the west side
 140  300   60
props rib_l seg 0 side left gap 36 off 12
props rib_r seg 0 side right gap 36 off 12
props rib_l seg 3 side left gap 36 off 12
props rib_r seg 3 side right gap 36 off 12
props rib_l seg 17 side left gap 36 off 12
props rib_r seg 17 side right gap 36 off 12
